    "longDescription": "WebCode in an ide(integrated development environment) for the web with support for html, css and javascript.\nIt features a powerful editor with support for auto completion(only for html and css), syntax highlighting and indentation.\n\n Features \n\n Editor \n- Auto Completion for html and css.\n- Previewing your html files.\n- Syntax highlighting for html, css, javascript and php.\n- Indentation.\n- Undo, Redo, Jump to, Find, Find and Replace.\n\n Console \n- Shows logs coloring them based on their level.\n\n File Manager \n- Access your files without leaving the app.\n- Copy, Paste and Delete.",
